@startuml ResNet18_Architecture

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #333333
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam DefaultFontSize 11

title **Arsitektur ResNet18 - Klasifikasi Kekeruhan Sungai**

|#FFFFFF|

(Start) --> [Input Layer\n(224×224×3)]

[Input Layer\n(224×224×3)] --> [ResNet18\n(Pre-trained ImageNet)]

[ResNet18\n(Pre-trained ImageNet)] --> [Convolutional Layer\nFilter: 64, kernel 7×7\nstride 2, padding 3\nactivation: ReLU, BatchNorm]

[Convolutional Layer\nFilter: 64, kernel 7×7\nstride 2, padding 3\nactivation: ReLU, BatchNorm] --> [Pooling Layer 1\nType: MaxPool\npool_size=3, stride=2\npadding=1]

[Pooling Layer 1\nType: MaxPool\npool_size=3, stride=2\npadding=1] --> [Conv Block Layer1\n2× BasicBlock, Filter: 64\nkernel 3×3, padding=1\nReLU + Skip Connection]

[Conv Block Layer1\n2× BasicBlock, Filter: 64\nkernel 3×3, padding=1\nReLU + Skip Connection] --> [Conv Block Layer2\n2× BasicBlock, Filter: 128\nkernel 3×3, stride 2\nReLU + Skip Connection]

[Conv Block Layer2\n2× BasicBlock, Filter: 128\nkernel 3×3, stride 2\nReLU + Skip Connection] --> [Conv Block Layer3\n2× BasicBlock, Filter: 256\nkernel 3×3, stride 2\nReLU + Skip Connection]

[Conv Block Layer3\n2× BasicBlock, Filter: 256\nkernel 3×3, stride 2\nReLU + Skip Connection] --> [Conv Block Layer4\n2× BasicBlock, Filter: 512\nkernel 3×3, stride 2\nReLU + Skip Connection]

[Conv Block Layer4\n2× BasicBlock, Filter: 512\nkernel 3×3, stride 2\nReLU + Skip Connection] --> [Pooling Layer 2\nType: AdaptiveAvgPool\noutput: 1×1]

[Pooling Layer 2\nType: AdaptiveAvgPool\noutput: 1×1] --> [Flatten Layer\n512 × 1 × 1 → 512]

[Flatten Layer\n512 × 1 × 1 → 512] --> [Dense Layer 1\nUnit: 256\nactivation: ReLU]

[Dense Layer 1\nUnit: 256\nactivation: ReLU] --> [Dropout Layer\nrate: 0.5]

[Dropout Layer\nrate: 0.5] --> [Dense Layer 2\nUnit: 2\n(Jernih / Keruh)]

[Dense Layer 2\nUnit: 2\n(Jernih / Keruh)] --> (End)

@enduml
